    {
      "uid": "zhcn:727275d5fd9700ca705f9267",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "──呼，那好。\n我们换个地方说话吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5905bbb9d02336e6ab4934f2c5b7af528cc960a212df8edea3e6743ee26370b4",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1018/storytimeline_501018304.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        28,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/28/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:09e1003fcfaf5ee19c0d406b",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我向气槽表示我来找她，\n是想跟她谈谈今后的竞赛──",
      "source_fingerprint": "b1d90544b8c998bb6d25fb4383f76f2336bd7644ea68bfa2d09aa2fa1689a9f1",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1018/storytimeline_501018304.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        29,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/29/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:64a5371152527046ec31751e",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "气槽",
      "source_fingerprint": "11b0d85f586c72905b86f884e647da7cea18f09793eb88ad129938776b139644",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1018/storytimeline_501018304.json",
      "json_path": [
