      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/3/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1df1ec801fd0fe01291582ba",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "是啊。\n我顺利完成了一项责任，但──",
      "source_fingerprint": "0ca36d2a1919f405ddea041a158d6207af263eb398e9d1e7d5a3381d498f769e",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1018/storytimeline_501018304.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        3,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/3/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cbb7e99ef5ef69e0b3555962",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "气槽",
      "source_fingerprint": "11b0d85f586c72905b86f884e647da7cea18f09793eb88ad129938776b139644",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1018/storytimeline_501018304.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        30,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/30/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3b975aa003ffdd8d21315ab8",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我要走后冠路线。\n目标是──“三后冠”。",
      "source_fingerprint": "731f4e6f8116a23ead79825a2d3dba06785251c7c8fe191a3dcba9adc80158c9",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1018/storytimeline_501018304.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        30,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/30/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d02a5c465f18425ba081c7e3",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "气槽如此坚定表示，\n语气比平常更加强而有力，没有一丝犹疑。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ee2cd7b8167bedf688b8049e5b6d576ffbb867e0bf3b2e254cc8a43d3ae08c7c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1018/storytimeline_501018304.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        31,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/31/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9243e3257f2f19f0b9f2efd5",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "后冠路线，指的是参加\n“樱花赏”、“橡树大赛”、“秋华赏”\n这三场竞赛。",
      "source_fingerprint": "983730d4423da7f051ddc02f233b43a8ca81a82d046941222bbd17b63571ea32",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1018/storytimeline_501018304.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        32,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/32/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cf3ce5b6f9c231206e42d6a9",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "每一场都是夙负盛名的GⅠ竞赛，\n只要获胜，就会留名于后世──",
      "source_fingerprint": "18dbe7f408ae21fa57b1a7058aec007ae6f297e7c12c3f91ec14a0d8b7b17341",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1018/storytimeline_501018304.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        33,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/33/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d806771a5be8575911da66bb",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "而“三后冠”更是至高无上的荣耀，\n只有称霸这三场竞赛的选手才能获得。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1b628223bbf9ddb3c5d5fe41f3420a6ead5418af5614f22e1d1a5face016a85f",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1018/storytimeline_501018304.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        34,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/34/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3a7f6c4bddbdba4f4b969716",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "气槽",
      "source_fingerprint": "11b0d85f586c72905b86f884e647da7cea18f09793eb88ad129938776b139644",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1018/storytimeline_501018304.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
